OL,3,ABritish widow faces deportation from
OL,4,ASweden after 22 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 78-year-old British widow has told
OL,7,Fthe BBC she is struggling to eat or
OL,8,Fsleep as the Swedish government
OL,9,Fthreatens to deport her over a late
OL,10,Fpost-Brexit residence application.
OL,12,FJoyce Thomas, a retired nurse, moved to
OL,13,FSweden 22 years ago with her husband,
OL,14,Fwho passed away from cancer three years
OL,15,Fago.
OL,17,FThe threat of deportation came after
OL,18,FSwedish authorities said they should
OL,19,Fhave made a formal application to stay
OL,20,Fin the country after Brexit.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
