OL,3,ABritish widow faces deportation from
OL,4,ASweden after 22 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas has since had numerous
OL,7,Fapplications and appeals rejected, and
OL,8,FTuesday marks the latest deadline for
OL,9,Fher to leave voluntarily.
